    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d277">

                <pb facs="0542" n="522" sameAs="frus:frus1864p2/pg522"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Lord Lyons.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Washington</hi>,</placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1864-02-17"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >February</hi> 17, 1864.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">My Lord</hi>: With reference to your note of the 20th
                    ultimo, in which, under the instructions of her Majesty’s government, you ask
                    for information as to the grounds of the seizure at New York, in the autumn of
                    last year, of the schooner Etta, and as to the steps taken by this government to
                    establish its legality against the British owners who claim the vessel, I have
                    the honor to enclose herewith the copy of a communication of the 12th instant,
                    addressed to this department by the Secretary of the Treasury, to whom the
                    matter was referred.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, with high consideration, your lordship’s obedient
                    servant.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Right Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lord Lyons</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d277-a1.xml" xpointer="d277-a1"/>
